# Overlay series fragment brand: applied after atlas/patches/series and the fragments before it
# (file-name order). Owner: ATLAS-BRAND-FORK (0011, 0012) and ATLAS-ANCHOR (0013, the policy directory). One entry per line, a path under atlas/patches.
# atlas-series refuses a patch listed twice and a patch number used twice, and warns when a number
# is outside this range:
# range: 0011-0019
brand/0011-about-version.patch
brand/0012-about-updates-row.patch
brand/0013-policy-directory.patch
